To launch joystick
ros2 launch teleop_twist_joy teleop-launch.py joy_config:='xbox' joy_dev:='0'0'


To launch all rpi stuff for manual control:

rpi4@rpi4:~/robot_ws$ colcon build --symlink-install
rpi4@rpi4:~/robot_ws$ sourc install/setup.bash
rpi4@rpi4:~/robot_ws$ ros2 run mdds30_driver cmdvel_to_mdds30 --ros-args -p port:=/dev/ttyAMA1 -p baud:=9600


If needed to edit code:
rpi4@rpi4:~/robot_ws/src/mdds30_driver/mdds30_driver$ nano cmdvel_to_mdds30.py
